<%# The save response for an entry edited in a report's popup iframe. A whole
    document rendered with no layout, carrying no chrome and no stylesheet: its
    only job is the flag plus the script that reads it. Accounts.init sees
    body[data-popup-saved], posts "saved" to the parent and stops — the parent
    then closes the modal and refetches the report. Without the script tag the
    flag is never read, the modal stays open and the report keeps the old
    figures. %>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="<%= I18n.locale %>">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <%= csp_meta_tag %>
    <%= javascript_importmap_tags "accounting" %>
  </head>
  <body data-popup-saved="true"></body>
</html>
